WEBVTT

00:00:58.287 --> 00:01:00.609
(Laughter)

00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:05.308
How many of you have ever
texted while driving?

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.556
OK, we're getting honest.
Let's test your honesty.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.582
How many people here in the last month

00:01:11.606 --> 00:01:14.492
have not always washed your hands
when you left the bathroom?

00:01:14.516 --> 00:01:16.154
(Laughter)

00:01:16.178 --> 00:01:17.352
A little less honest.

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:21.003
By the way, it's interesting how we're
willing to admit texting and driving

00:01:21.027 --> 00:01:23.076
but not washing our hands,
that's difficult.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.800
(Laughter)

00:01:25.389 --> 00:01:26.666
We can go on and on.

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:29.453
The problem, the topic is
that there's lots of things

00:01:29.477 --> 00:01:31.521
when we know what we could do --